## Your location while you work

The first time, the portal asks you to accept the electronic monitoring policy (you get a copy by email). After that, while you are clocked in or on a job, the portal or the CarmaCars app shares where you are with Admins and Fleet. Off duty nothing is taken. You can turn sharing off in **Profile** > **Location sharing**, except during an active job.',
